micropolis-activity (0.0.20260210+gitc98f6b0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package the current upstream master snapshot at commit c98f6b0.
  * Rebuild the Debian packaging for current Debian systems.
  * Preserve the historical micropolis/micropolis-data package split and
    filesystem layout for upgrade compatibility.
  * Build with the Debian toolchain, dpkg-buildflags, hardening flags and
    cross-toolchain variables instead of the upstream hard-coded compiler
    and /usr/X11R6 paths.
  * Stop stripping binaries during the upstream build so debhelper can
    produce normal debug information.
  * Drop the obsolete x11proto-xext-dev transitional dependency.
  * Use system DejaVu fonts rather than shipping duplicate font files.
  * Fix legacy C declarations required by modern compilers.
  * Add desktop integration, doc-base registration and an Xvfb autopkgtest.
  * Document the current Micropolis public-name trademark license.

 -- Reaper <johngrimmreaper@disroot.org>  Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:00:00 -0300
